{"id":"c04","stage":0,"title":"一杯咖啡","scene":"在咖啡馆练习点单和数量。","roles":["店员","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c04-1","ko":"뭘 드릴까요?","zh":"您要点什么？","note":"服务人员用 드릴까요 礼貌地询问需求。","words":[{"term":"드리다","zh":"给（敬语）","id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/af278936cfd6522576de.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇을 → 뭘；무엇（什么）+ 을（宾格助词）。","readings":[{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}]},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"给您呢？","explanation":"드리다（给，对接受者表示尊敬）+ -(으)ㄹ까요（询问对方意愿）；服务场景意为“您要点什么”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c04-2","ko":"커피 한 잔 주세요.","zh":"请给我一杯咖啡。","note":"하나 在量词前变成 한；잔 用于数杯。","words":[{"term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","id":"a4215a3126661d52","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"},{"term":"하나","zh":"一（固有数词）","id":"556dcbf069a950eb","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"},{"term":"잔","zh":"杯（量词）","id":"ca06065856b9c29b","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/5bd5f3f50023cdf46088.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"커피","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피是名词，说明点的饮品。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나（一）在量词前用한。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}]},{"text":"잔","meaning":"杯","explanation":"잔是数杯装饮品的量词。","readings":[{"term":"잔","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"请给我","explanation":"주다（给）+ -세요（礼貌请求）；整句为点单请求。","readings":[{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c04-3","ko":"따뜻한 걸로 드릴까요?","zh":"给您热的，可以吗？","note":"따뜻한 修饰后面的东西；걸로 是 것으로 的缩略。","words":[{"term":"따뜻하다","zh":"温热","id":"e4840ad0903352f1","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/c9158245e0ce3c2b1989.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"따뜻한","meaning":"热的","explanation":"따뜻하다（温热）+ 定语形-ㄴ → 따뜻한。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}]},{"text":"걸로","meaning":"这种","explanation":"것으로 → 걸로；것（东西）+ 으로（表示选择）。","readings":[{"term":"걸로","audio":"/audio/1b8e4a8a07526f3975bb.mp3"}]},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"给您，可以吗？","explanation":"드리다（给您）+ -(으)ㄹ까요（询问意愿）。","readings":[{"term":"드릴까요","audio":"/audio/235c96fe68d709255264.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c04-4","ko":"아니요, 차가운 걸로 주세요.","zh":"不用，请给我冷的。","note":"차가운 表示温度低；句子没有明确要求加冰，所以不直接译成“加冰的”。","words":[{"term":"아니요","zh":"不是；不","id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"},{"term":"차갑다","zh":"凉；冷","id":"489db26a6bdebee8","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/4c0dbbec45c20e9ae32c.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不用","explanation":"아니요是对上一个提问的否定回答。","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}]},{"text":"차가운","meaning":"冷的","explanation":"차갑다（冷）→ 차가운；ㅂ不规则变化后接定语语尾-ㄴ。","readings":[{"term":"차갑다","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}]},{"text":"걸로","meaning":"这种","explanation":"것으로的口语缩略；表示选冷的饮品。","readings":[{"term":"걸로","audio":"/audio/1b8e4a8a07526f3975bb.mp3"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"请给我","explanation":"주다（给）+ -세요（礼貌请求）。","readings":[{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c04-5","ko":"사천 원이에요.","zh":"四千韩元。","note":"价格用汉字数词：사천 是四千。","words":[{"term":"사천","zh":"四千","id":"95328a17c97f1bcc","audio":"/audio/95328a17c97f1bcc50b3.mp3"},{"term":"원","zh":"韩元","id":"c19fd6787279897c","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/00e9b6d46ce7c4705468.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"사천","meaning":"四千","explanation":"사（四）+ 천（千），汉字数词表示金额。","readings":[{"term":"사천","audio":"/audio/95328a17c97f1bcc50b3.mp3"}]},{"text":"원이에요.","meaning":"韩元","explanation":"원（韩元）+ 이에요（是，礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c04-6","ko":"카드로 계산할게요.","zh":"我刷卡付款。","note":"-(으)로 表示方式，-ㄹ게요 表示自己的打算。","words":[{"term":"카드","zh":"卡","id":"62b41b5aaec6fef4","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3"},{"term":"계산하다","zh":"结账","id":"789e5000e94e1329","audio":"/audio/789e5000e94e13298d23.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/208a1350f702f9cd1e2b.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"카드로","meaning":"用卡","explanation":"카드（卡）+ 로（方式或手段）。","readings":[{"term":"카드","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3"}]},{"text":"계산할게요.","meaning":"我来结账","explanation":"계산하다（结账）+ -ㄹ게요（向对方表明自己的打算）。","readings":[{"term":"계산하다","audio":"/audio/789e5000e94e13298d23.mp3"}]}]}],"day":16,"sequenceScore":0.96,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["给您热的，可以吗？","给您冰的，可以吗？","您要把它带走吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["三千韩元。","四千韩元。","四万韩元。"],"answer":1}]}
